  "id": "005426B8",
  "zh": "contain the power of all living things."
 },
 {
  "id": "005426E0",
  "zh": "A very mystifying树果. No telling"
 },
 {
  "id": "00542704",
  "zh": "what may happen or how it can be used."
 },
 {
  "id": "0054272C",
  "zh": "Said to be a legendary树果."
 },
 {
  "id": "0054274C",
  "zh": "Holding it supposedly brings joy."
 },
 {
  "id": "00542770",
  "zh": "So strong, it was abandoned at the"
 },
 {
  "id": "00542794",
  "zh": "world's edge. Considered a mirage."
 },
 {
  "id": "005427B8",
  "zh": "A completely enigmatic树果."
 },
 {
  "id": "005427D8",
  "zh": "Appears to have the power of stars."
 },
 {
  "id": "005427FC",
  "zh": "Said to grow in the tropics once,"
 },
 {
  "id": "00542820",
  "zh": "it boasts an intensely hot spiciness."
 },
 {
  "id": "00542848",
  "zh": "Its flesh是 dotted with many tiny"
 },
 {
  "id": "0054286C",
  "zh": "bubbles that keep it afloat in water."
 },
 {
  "id": "00542894",
  "zh": "Energy drawn from lightning strikes"
 },
 {
  "id": "005428B8",
  "zh": "makes this树果 grow big和rich."
 },
 {
  "id": "005428DC",
  "zh": "This berry has a vegetable-like flavor,"
 },
 {
  "id": "00542904",
  "zh": "but是 rich in health-promoting fiber."
 },
 {
  "id": "0054292C",
  "zh": "This树果 has a refreshing dry and"
 },
 {
  "id": "00542950",
  "zh": "sour flavor. Tastes better chilled."
 },
 {
  "id": "00542974",
  "zh": "Contains a substance that generates"
 },
 {
  "id": "00542998",
  "zh": "heat. Can even fire up a chilly heart."
 },
 {
  "id": "005429C0",
  "zh": "Brilliant green on the outside, inside"
 },
 {
  "id": "005429E8",
  "zh": "it是 packed with black-colored flesh."
 },
 {
  "id": "00542A10",
  "zh": "The sweet pulp has just the hint of a"
 },
 {
  "id": "00542A38",
  "zh": "a hard-edged和fragrant bite to it."
 },
 {
  "id": "00542A60",
  "zh": "This树果是 said to be a cross of"
 },
 {
  "id": "00542A84",
  "zh": "two Berries blown in from far away."
 },
 {
  "id": "00542AA8",
  "zh": "Said to sense human emotions, it swells"
 },
 {
  "id": "00542AD0",
  "zh": "roundly when a person approaches."
 },
 {
  "id": "00542AF4",
  "zh": "It grows a flower at the tip that lures"
 },
 {
  "id": "00542B1C",
  "zh": "虫 宝可梦 with its stringy petals."
 },
 {
  "id": "00542B44",
  "zh": "Often used for pickles because of its"
 },
 {
  "id": "00542B6C",
  "zh": "dry flavor. Sometimes eaten raw."
 },
 {
  "id": "00542B90",
  "zh": "Old superstitions say it has an odd"
 },
 {
  "id": "00542BB4",
  "zh": "power. A popular good-luck charm."
 },
 {
  "id": "00542BD8",
  "zh": "Less bitter if enough of this树果"
 },
 {
  "id": "00542BFC",
  "zh": "is boiled down. Makes a good jam."
 },
 {
  "id": "00542C20",
  "zh": "Tiny hooks on the surface latch onto"
 },
 {
  "id": "00542C46",
  "zh": "  宝可梦 to reach far-off places."
 },
 {
  "id": "00542C6C",
  "zh": "Very tough with a strong flavor. It"
 },
 {
  "id": "00542C90",
  "zh": "was used to make medicine in the past."
 },
 {
  "id": "00542CB8",
  "zh": "It can be made into a whistle that"
 },
 {
  "id": "00542CDC",
  "zh": "produces an indescribable sound."
 },
 {
  "id": "00542D00",
  "zh": "In nature, they grow in wide rings"
 },
 {
  "id": "00542D24",
  "zh": "for reasons that是 still unknown."
 },
 {
  "id": "00542D48",
  "zh": "It has the effect of making other food"
 },
 {
  "id": "00542D70",
  "zh": "eaten at the same time taste sweet."
 },
 {
  "id": "00542D94",
  "zh": "The flesh underneath the 释陀果's"
 },
 {
  "id": "00542DBC",
  "zh": "skin是 sweet和creamy soft."
 },
 {
  "id": "00542DDC",
  "zh": "The drupelets that make up this berry"
 },
 {
  "id": "00542E04",
  "zh": "pop rythmically if it's handled roughly."
 },
 {
  "id": "00542E30",
  "zh": "People once worked top-shaped pieces"
 },
 {
  "id": "00542E58",
  "zh": "of this berry free to use as toys."
 },
 {
  "id": "00542E7C",
  "zh": "A berry that是 incredibly spicy at"
 },
 {
  "id": "00542EA0",
  "zh": "first, then extremely bitter."
 },
 {
  "id": "00542EC0",
  "zh": "Its outside是 very bitter, but its"
 },
 {
  "id": "00542EE4",
  "zh": "inside tastes like a sweet drink."
 },
